        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 802SE, Oval Dummy Shelburne Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA two piece handleset, the Shelburne has a simple elegance that will go well with traditional style homes. This simple Shelburne Handleset features oval mounts. A dummy cylinder, the Kwikset made 802SE Door Entry Set does not function and is usually used as a pull for the inactive side of double doors. Solid brass construction it is backed by a Kwikset Lifetime finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/shelburne-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800se\"><b>Shelburne Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Traditional Shelburne Dummy Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li> Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Two Piece 802SE Shelburne Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 18-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 12-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Deadbolt to Center of Top Plate: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt: 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Shelburne Dummy Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 802SE",
                "description": "Kwikset 802SE Shelburne Dummy Cylinder Handleset - A two piece handleset, the Shelburne has a simple elegance that will go well with traditional style homes. This simple Shelburne Handleset features oval mounts. A dummy cylinder, the Kwikset made 802SE Door Entry Set does not function and is usually used as a pull for the inactive side of double doors. Solid brass construction it is backed by a 10 year finish warranty.",
